  "job_B1.5.12_20251001_193243": {
    "chunk_text": "to geh\u00e6lenne \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fee of mancynne on middan earde losode. \u00d0es rica Zacheus wolde \u00feone h\u00e6lend geseon ac he ne mihte for \u00fe\u00e6re meniu, ne eac \u00fea lenge n\u00e6fde. \u00dea arn he beforan & astah uppan \u00fe\u00e6t fores\u00e6de treo \u00fe\u00e6t he hine geseon mihte. Se h\u00e6lend eac \u00fea geseah his godan willan, & cw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t he wolde to him gecyrran, & on his huse hine He ne dorste \u00feone h\u00e6lend to his huse la\u00f0ian, ac mid \u00fe\u00e6re gewilnunge \u00fee he wolde hine geseon, he Se h\u00e6lend beseah up wi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6s rican, & he hine geseah, for\u00fean\u00fee he hine geceas fram \u00feam woroldlicum Godes gesyh\u00f0 getacna\u00f0 his gecorennesse o\u00f0\u00f0e his lufe, swaswa hit awriten is, Oculi domini super We menn eac swylce \u00fea \u00feing \u00fee we lufia\u00f0 we gewilnia\u00f0 to geseonne, & fram \u00feam \u00fee we onscunia\u00f0, we Se h\u00e6lend geseah \u00feone welegan, for\u00fean\u00fee se welega geseah hine, & Crist geceas \u00feone \u00fee hine geceas, \u00de\u00e6s folces meniu \u00fee mid \u00feam h\u00e6lende ferde hremdon \u00feone rican \u00fe\u00e6t he ne mihte \u00feone h\u00e6lend geseon, Hi forbudon \u00feam blindan \u00fe\u00e6t he to \u00feam h\u00e6lende ne clypode, ac he clypode \u00fe\u00e6s \u00fee swi\u00f0or, o\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t se Seo meniu \u00fee hine hremdon getacnodon \u00fea fl\u00e6sclican lustas, \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6s mannes mod oft hrepa\u00f0, \u00feonne he \u00de\u00e6t treowcynn is sicom",
